*.pfx           binary
*.der           binary
*.png           binary
*.jpg           binary
*.jpeg          binary
*.gif           binary
*.ico           binary
*.webp          binary
*.woff          binary
*.woff2         binary
*.ttf           binary
*.zip           binary
*.gz            binary
